---

### 3. Updated Feature Documentation ✅

**Updated File**: [FEATURES.md](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/docs/FEATURES.md)

**Additions**:
- **Semantic Zoom**: Dynamic grouping by Day/Week/Month/Year
- **Timeline Scrubber**: Interactive date navigation with draggable bubble
- **Dual-View Architecture**: Switch between Semantic and Tiles views
- **RAW Format Support**: CR2, NEF, ARW, DNG via LibRaw
- **Network Share Support**: Full UNC path compatibility (`\\Server\Share`)
- **Info Panel**: Metadata viewing and file information
- **Open in Explorer**: Quick file location feature
- **TaskScheduler v2**: Separate CPU and I/O queues with priorities
- **Smart Video Thumbnails**: Black frame detection
- **Hybrid RAW Loading**: Fast preview vs full decode
- **UI Thread Protection**: All blocking operations offloaded

