## Documentation Structure

```
docs/
├── README.md                      # Project overview, quick start, version history
├── ARCHITECTURE.md                # System architecture, components, dependencies
├── BUILD.md                       # Build instructions, deployment guide
├── FEATURES.md                    # Feature list with technical details
├── DEVELOPMENT_PRINCIPLES.md      # ⭐ NEW: Coding standards & best practices
├── THREAD_HIERARCHY.md            # Threading model and bottleneck analysis
├── PROGRESS.md                    # Development history and session notes
├── KNOWN_ISSUES.md                # Known bugs and limitations
└── SEMANTIC_ZOOM_IMPLEMENTATION.md # Specific feature deep-dive
```

